{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"yululu-e-4c019cd6b6e13040a765","title":"骆统上疏陈征役疫疠及户口减耗，请休养兵民","accounts":[{"id":"yululu-a-4c019cd6b6e13040a765","label":"正文","text":"骆统上疏陈征役疫疠及户口减耗，请休养兵民","evidence":["yululu-q-c884bdbd6cb4a7c3dcab","yululu-q-265f37bbbc25603a471d","yululu-q-03e08273c7afc5c15008","yululu-q-f0387787fcaa46d8b349","yululu-q-54672e7dd0747c7b2899","yululu-q-722887f0e36a534122cd"]}],"participants":[{"person":"luxun-p0026","role":"上疏陈兵民困敝者","evidence":["yululu-q-c884bdbd6cb4a7c3dcab","yululu-q-265f37bbbc25603a471d","yululu-q-03e08273c7afc5c15008","yululu-q-f0387787fcaa46d8b349","yululu-q-54672e7dd0747c7b2899","yululu-q-722887f0e36a534122cd"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["yululu-q-c884bdbd6cb4a7c3dcab","yululu-q-265f37bbbc25603a471d","yululu-q-03e08273c7afc5c15008","yululu-q-f0387787fcaa46d8b349","yululu-q-54672e7dd0747c7b2899","yululu-q-722887f0e36a534122cd"]},"ordering_evidence":"yululu-q-c884bdbd6cb4a7c3dcab","order":10219}],"persons":[{"id":"luxun-p0026","name":"骆统","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"yululu-q-03e08273c7afc5c15008","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-5df24cbddc39f5362b08","layer":"original","quote":"今强敌未殄，海内未乂〖9〗；三军有无已之役，江境有不释之备。征赋调数，由来积纪〖10〗；加以殃疫死丧之灾，郡县荒虚，田畴芜旷。听闻属城，民户浸寡〖11〗；又多残老，少有丁夫。闻此之日，心若焚燎。思寻所由，小民无知，既有安土重迁之性，且又前后出为兵者；生则困苦无有温饱，死则委弃骸骨不反。是以尤用恋本〖12〗，畏远同之于死。每有征发，羸谨居家重累者先见输送；小有财货，倾居行赂〖13〗，不顾穷尽；轻剽者则迸入险阻〖14〗，党就群恶。百姓虚竭，嗷然愁扰〖15〗。愁扰则不营业〖16〗，不营业则致穷困，致穷困则不乐生，故口腹急则奸心动而携叛多也〖17〗。","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":331,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":274,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-265f37bbbc25603a471d","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-32c3feafa03918cfeed0","layer":"original","quote":"臣闻君国者〖2〗，以据疆土为强富，制威福为尊贵，曜德义为荣显，永世胤为丰祚〖3〗。然财须民生〖4〗，强赖民力，威恃民势，福由民殖，德俟民茂〖5〗，义以民行：六者既备，然后应天受祚，保族宜邦。《书》曰：‘众非后无能胥以宁〖6〗，后非众无以辟四方〖7〗。’推是言之，则民以君安，君以民济〖8〗：不易之道也。","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":330,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":151,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-54672e7dd0747c7b2899","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-0c4cd09a50ba4f746491","layer":"original","quote":"夫国之有民，犹水之有舟；停则以安，扰则以危；愚而不可欺，弱而不可胜。是以圣王重焉，祸福由之；故与民消息〖23〗，观时制政。方今长吏，亲民之职，惟以办具为能〖24〗，取过目前之急〖25〗；少复以恩惠为治，副称殿下天覆之仁，勤恤之德者。官民政俗，日以凋弊；渐以陵迟〖26〗，势不可久！","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":333,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":140,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-722887f0e36a534122cd","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-5e18bfba08447dfc58dd","layer":"original","quote":"夫治疾及其未笃〖27〗，除患贵其未深；愿殿下少以万机余闲，留神思省。补复荒虚，深图远计；育残余之民，阜人财之用〖28〗；参曜三光〖29〗，等崇天地〖30〗。臣统之大愿，足以死而不朽矣。","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":334,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":92,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-c884bdbd6cb4a7c3dcab","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-ee9826979bb807856355","layer":"original","quote":"是时征役繁数，重以疫疠〖1〗，民户损耗。统上疏曰：","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":329,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":25,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-f0387787fcaa46d8b349","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-9aa65f678301d68d473a","layer":"original","quote":"又闻民间，非居处小能自供，生产儿子多不起养〖18〗；屯田贫兵，亦多弃子。天则生之，而父母杀之：既惧干逆和气〖19〗，感动阴阳；且惟殿下开基建国，乃无穷之业也，强邻大敌非造次所灭〖20〗，疆埸常守非期月之戍〖21〗，而兵民减耗，后生不育〖22〗，非所以历远年，致成功也！","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":332,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":134,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
